<note version="8.3" severity="warning">
Since Version 8.3, EAGLE supports URNs for individual library
assets (packages, symbols, and devices). The URNs of those assets
will not be understood (or retained) with this version.
</note>
<note version="8.3" severity="warning">
Since Version 8.3, EAGLE supports the association of 3D packages
with devices in libraries, schematics, and board files. Those 3D
packages will not be understood (or retained) with this version.
</note>
<note version="9.7" severity="warning">
Since Fusion, design files support named views saved in design. 
Named views found in the design will not be understood with this version. 
</note>
<note version="9.7" minversion="9.7.0" severity="warning">
Since Version 9.7.0 new layer stackup definition has been added,
which will not be loaded with this version.
</note>
<note version="9.7" minversion="9.7.0" severity="warning">
Since Version 9.7.0 new active CAMJOB file name has been added,
which will not be loaded with this version.
</note>
<note version="9.7" minversion="9.7.0" severity="warning">
Since Version 9.7.0 board construction lines has been added,
which will not be loaded with this version.
</note>
<note version="9.7" minversion="9.7.0" severity="warning">
Since Version 9.7.0 new design rule definitions have been added,
which will not be loaded with this version.
</note>
</compatibility>
</eagle>
